<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals group to set processed product refunds.</title>
<headline>EU cereals group to set processed product refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union cereals management committee will set refunds for processed products and starch at a two-day meeting starting on Thursday, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The cereals and rice management committee will fix processed product refunds for processed products in Annex II, non-Annex II and compound feed,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The committee is also scheduled to fix refunds for starch.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6800</p>
